      "text": "{\"story\":{\"as_a\":\"user\",\"i_want\":\"download the filtered, searched and sorted task report as an Excel file\",\"so_that\":\"I can work with the task data in a spreadsheet outside the application\",\"business_description\":\"Users can export the task report to Excel. The exported file reflects the rows, order and filters the user has applied on the report page, so the user gets the same view of the data as on screen.\",\"business_value\":\"Task data can be reviewed and used outside the application in a spreadsheet, using the same filters and sort order the user already set.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[{\"given\":\"The task report page shows 12 tasks with no filters applied\",\"when\":\"The user selects the Excel export action\",\"then\":\"An Excel file is downloaded that contains 12 data rows, one per task\"},{\"given\":\"The report has the Status filter set to Open and is sorted by Due Date ascending\",\"when\":\"The user selects the Excel export action\",\"then\":\"The downloaded file contains only tasks with status Open, in ascending Due Date order\"},{\"given\":\"The report has a title search term applied that matches 3 tasks, combined with the Status filter set to Open\",\"when\":\"The user selects the Excel export action\",\"then\":\"The downloaded file contains only the tasks that match both the search term and the Open status, in the same order as on the report page\"},{\"given\":\"The user exports the report at a given moment\",\"when\":\"The file is downloaded\",\"then\":\"The file name contains the timestamp of the moment the file was generated\"},{\"given\":\"The applied filters match no tasks\",\"when\":\"The user selects the Excel export action\",\"then\":\"No Excel file is downloaded and a message is shown to the user stating that there is no data to export\"},{\"given\":\"A report with at least one task is exported\",\"when\":\"The user opens the downloaded Excel file\",\"then\":\"The first row contains clear column headers and every date column uses the same date format\"}],\"edge_cases\":[\"The PRD does not define the wording of the no-data message, or whether a file is still produced when there is no data. This is an open question.\",\"The PRD does not define the timestamp format or time zone used in the file name. This is an open question.\",\"The PRD does not define the date format for date columns. One format must be chosen and applied to every date column.\",\"The PRD does not state whether a title search counts as a filter. The export applies the search the same way the report page does.\",\"A report with exactly one task produces a file with one data row.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"US-create-task\",\"US-view-task-report\",\"US-filter-search-sort-report\"],\"definition_of_done\":[\"The export action on the task report page downloads a file that matches the filtered, searched and sorted rows shown on the page\",\"Exporting a result with no rows shows a message and downloads no file\",\"The Excel file generation location is documented with rationale and trade-offs before generator work starts\",\"Every exported file has a timestamped name and a header row with clear column headers\",\"Every date column in an exported file uses one date format\",\"All acceptance criteria are verified by the export test suite\"]},\"tasks\":[{\"key_slug\":\"excel-export-generation-decision\",\"title\":\"[BE] Decide and document where the task report Excel file is generated\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Choose whether the Excel file is generated on the frontend or the backend, and record the rationale and trade-offs. The generator and export action tasks start only after this decision is documented.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-3a63e0ce\"],\"derived_reason\":\"decision_spike\",\"is_spike\":true,\"definition_of_done\":[\"A decision record states whether the Excel file is generated on the frontend or the backend, with rationale and trade-offs\",\"The decision record states which component produces the file and what the frontend receives when a file is produced\",\"The decision record is shared with the team before the generator and export action tasks start\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"task-report-excel-generator\",\"title\":\"[BE] Add report Excel generator producing a timestamped file\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Produce an Excel file from the task report rows, in the applied sort order, using the filter, search and sort parameters of the report query. Column headers are clear and every date column uses one date format. The file name includes the generation timestamp. If the documented decision places generation in the frontend, the scope of this task changes before work starts.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-52360b76\",\"R-09e9d163\",\"R-d22b9b6a\",\"R-fad183b1\",\"R-8007d6b5\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The generator accepts the same filter, search and sort parameters as the report query and adds no new filter parameters\",\"Exported rows match the report query result for the same parameters, one row per task, in the same order\",\"The file name follows one fixed pattern and includes the timestamp of generation\",\"The first row holds column headers and every date column uses the same date format\",\"The generator is called only with rows to export; the no-data case is handled by the frontend export action\",\"Unit tests cover headers, date format, row order and file name\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"report-excel-download-action\",\"title\":\"[FE] Add Excel export action that downloads the filtered and sorted report\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Add an Excel export action to the task report page. The action sends the currently applied filters, search term and sort order to the generator and downloads the returned file. Starts after the generator endpoint is available.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-52360b76\",\"R-09e9d163\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The export action is available on the task report page\",\"The request carries the currently applied filters, title search term and sort order\",\"The downloaded file uses the file name returned by the generator, including its timestamp\",\"The no-data check runs before any file request is made\",\"If the generator call fails, an error message is shown and no success state is displayed\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"report-export-no-data-message\",\"title\":\"[FE] Show a no-data message instead of producing an empty Excel file\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Add the no-data check to the export action. When the currently loaded filtered report has no rows, show a message to the user and do not request or download a file. This is the only place where the no-data case is handled. The wording of the message is not specified in the PRD; this is an open question to confirm with the product owner.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-437992f1\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"Exporting a report with zero rows after filters are applied shows a message and requests no file\",\"The message wording is confirmed with the product owner before release\",\"Exporting a report with at least one row does not show the no-data message\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"excel-export-test-suite\",\"title\":\"[QA] Add test suite for the task report Excel export\",\"track\":\"qa_general\",\"area\":\"qa\",\"description\":\"Test suite for the Excel export covering row contents, row order, filters, title search, file name timestamp, column headers, date format and the no-data behaviour. Runs after the export action and the generator are in place.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-52360b76\",\"R-09e9d163\",\"R-d22b9b6a\",\"R-437992f1\",\"R-fad183b1\",\"R-8007d6b5\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"Tests cover export with no filters, with a status filter, and with a title search\",\"Tests check the row count, the row order and that exported rows match the report on screen\",\"Tests check the file name timestamp and the header row\",\"Tests check that every date column uses the same date format\",\"Tests check that no file is downloaded and a message is shown when there are no rows\",\"The test suite runs in the project's automated test run and passes\"]}]}",
